SUMMARY:Toronto Summer Music Festival:  Prodigies & Power
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will attend 3 concerts at this year
 's Toronto Summer Music Festival.\n\nYou could use the 10% off promo code 
 for tickets ($45-$80).\n\nGenius often reveals itself early — and boldly
 . Dohnányi’s Piano Quintet\, written at 17 and praised by Brahms\, brim
 s with youthful ambition. Mendelssohn’s C minor Trio shows that same pro
 digious spirit transformed into sweeping Romantic authority. Prokofiev’s
  brilliant Sonata for Two Violins opens the night with sharp wit and kinet
 ic drive. An evening of fearless invention and blazing artistry.\n\nAndrew
  Wan\, violin\nJonathan Crow\, violin\nSharon Wei\, viola\nRachel Mercer\,
  cello\nOrion Weiss\, piano\n\n**PROGRAM**:\n\nProkofiev: Sonata in C Majo
 r for Two Violins\, Op. 56\nMendelssohn: Piano Trio No. 2 in C minor\, Op.
  66\nDohnányi: Piano Quintet No. 1 in C minor\, Op. 1\n\n**Ticket link he
 re**:\n\nhttps://torontosummermusic.com/event/prodigies-power/\n\n\\*\\*\\
 *Use this promo code for 10% off your ticket price (ADULT ticket price)---
 -**CULTURE10**
