SUMMARY:ROM:  Weston International Award--Evening with Hanif Abdurraqib ($
 20)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nAlways a HOT ticket--an important (int
 ernational) AUTHOR Talk. At the ROM.\n\n($15-$20 only!!)\n\nAmerican autho
 r **Hanif Abdurraqib has won the 2026 Weston International Award. $75\,000
 **\n\n**Overview--**\n\nThe evening will feature **Hanif Abdurraquib** del
 ivering a talk and having an in-depth conversation with **CBC ARTS.**\n\n\
 \*\\*\\*Join us on Monday\, September 14 at the Royal Ontario Museum\, for
  an evening with the 2026 Weston International Award winner\, hosted by Al
 i Hassan of CBC’s Canada Reads.\n\n**Hanif Abdurraqib is an American mem
 oirist and poet known for his distinctive style of cultural and artistic c
 riticism through the lens of music\,** **sport\, and contemporary American
  issues**. In a creative and wide-ranging talk\, he will bring his unique 
 and rare intellect to the role of nonfiction in our society\, and his rela
 tionship to it as someone from an unconventional background.\n\nHe’ll th
 en sit down for wide-ranging and free-wheeling conversation with a member 
 of the award jury and author Tessa McWatt. Jurors said his “work sings a
 nd stings and brings truths\, both personal and communal\, as he voices cu
 lture and its complexities with bold\, compassionate lyricism and a real s
 ense of love\,” and that is what he will bring to the stage.\n\n***The $
 75\,000 prize is a companion to the existing Hilary Weston Writers' Trust 
 Prize for Nonfiction\, which is awarded annually to a Canadian author for 
 a single work of nonfiction.***\n\nThe Weston International Award recogniz
 es the career achievement of an international author for a body of nonfict
 ion work. Eligible international authors must have published at least thre
 e books of outstanding literary merit\, in the genre of nonfiction\, that 
 are written in English or else widely available in translation.\n\n**Ticke
 t link here:**\n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/the-weston-international-awa
 rd-presents-an-evening-with-hanif-abdurraqib-tickets-1983560042483?aff=odd
 tdtcreator\n\n**Recent interview on CBC:**\n\nhttps://www.cbc.ca/books/ame
 rican-author-hanif-abdurraqib-wins-75k-weston-international-award-for-care
 er-achievement-in-nonfiction-9.7235796\n\nSEE you there.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-arts-and-culture/events/31548
